      "title": "El Forge Limited Announces Resignation of K. R. Srihari as Chief Executive Officer, Effective June 17, 2026",
      "body": "El Forge Limited announced that Mr. K. R. Srihari resigned as Chief Executive Officer of the company with effect from close of business hours on June 17, 2026. K. R. Srihari is an MBA from National Australian University. Soon after completing his PG he has been working in EL Forge from 2007. He has gained experience in the operations of the company and was presently the Chief Executive Officer. K.R.Srihari is an MBA from National Australian University. Soon after completing his PG he has been working in EL Forge from 2007. He has gained experience in the operations of the company and presently the Chief Executive Officer . He is now inducted to the Board as Executive Director (Operations). He is Son of Mr. K.V.Ramachandran, Vice Chairman & Managing Director.",
